# Regenerable bulk.  This directory is 8.0 GB on disk and all of it rebuilds
# from run_all.sh / run_validation.sh plus the read-only catalog inputs; what is
# NOT regenerable is the code, the notes, and the small JSON summaries that
# carry the measured numbers, so those stay tracked.
output*/

# Q tables and fitted curves: 36 h5 (399 MB each) + 830 MB of npz outside
# output*/ alone.
*.h5
*.npz
*.npy

# 35 MB of plots, and every one of them is a `plot_completeness.py` invocation
# away.  The closure_summary.json next to them is the part worth keeping.
*.png

__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
